{"id": "85918", "name": "חילוק שברים – p/n ÷ q/m (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>What is the value of: \\[\\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} \\div \\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}},\\] [[input:ans1]]. [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Recall that to divide by a fraction you can flip one of the fractions (swap its denominator and numerator), change the divide sign to a multiply and proceed like you usually would.</p>\n <p>So we get: \\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} \\div \\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}} &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} \\times \\frac{{CT:3}}{{CT:2}}, \\\\\\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:0}}\\times {{CT:3}}}{{{CT:1}}\\times {{CT:2}}}, \\\\\\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}. \\end{array}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sa", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "FRC-DIVISION-RULE-FALSE", "feedback": "<p>It seems you have forgotten to swap the numerator and denominator.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "m", "n", "p", "q", "sa", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}